      "Drifting too early and pulling the help with you.",
      "Feet on the line."
    ],
    "safety": "Driver stops before the baseline; no driving into the shooter's lane.",
    "progressions": ["Add a defender recovering to the corner.", "Shooter drives the closeout."],
